  "$comment": [
    "USDM Edit Viewer · tools/fixtures/findings-map.json — WP-C's map fixture.",
    "",
    "HAND-MADE, AND EVERY POLYGON IS A RECTANGLE. This file exists to exercise",
    "js/map.js: that the four viewer sources receive what they are handed, that",
    "the ladder puts each layer where the contract says, that hitTest resolves",
    "conflict > one-sided > seam > change over SOURCE data, and that the",
    "letters and dashes js/marks.js assigns reach the map. It is NOT a",
    "comparison-engine fixture and nothing here was computed by js/compare.js:",
    "the class labels, the areas and the run lengths are plausible rather than",
    "derived, and the bands are schematic. tools/compare.test.mjs owns the real",
    "corpus (demo/, twelve packages).",
    "",
    "The coordinates ARE real Northern Great Plains ground, in true WGS84 —",
    "the same convention the USDM and the fsa-lfp-counties family use, never",
    "the fleet's shifted composite. Two working areas (Montana and Wyoming,",
    "as bounding rectangles), three proposals, four patches, one conflict, one",
    "one-sided region, one reciprocal seam along the MT/WY line at 45°N and one",
    "one-sided seam along the MT/ND meridian at 104.04°W whose far side is the",
    "published week (North Dakota is deliberately not loaded).",
    "",
    "Shapes follow docs/contracts.md §§ 2, 4, 5 and 10."
  ],

